%% One round in the leaderless mesh. Every peer runs every step itself; no step has a leader.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Hospital A (any peer)
  participant P as Every other peer
  Note over A,P: round r: same manifest derived on every node from the installed model hash (ctx)
  A->>A: train locally (DP-SGD), clip, quantise Q16.16, sign (ACFA-CONTRIB2)
  opt blind mode
    A->>A: add pairwise X25519 masks, commit to the clear update
  end
  A->>P: gossip delta of the CRDT set (random order, delay, duplicates, partitions)
  P->>A: gossip their deltas
  Note over A,P: CRDT union is commutative, associative, idempotent: same set means same state hash
  A->>A: close when all participants are in, or at least Q after the deadline
  A->>A: ACFA locally (multi-Krum in robust mode, exact sum of masked set in blind mode), issue receipt
  A->>P: gossip co-signature over (state root, output root, receipt hash, candidate hash, leaves)
  P->>A: gossip their co-signatures
  alt Q matching co-signatures (2Q > n+f)
    A->>A: accept the quorum root, recompute if it closed on a partial set
  else equivocation, lying root or invalid signature
    A->>A: record evidence in TypedTrustScore (public API), quarantine at 0.1 or below
  else no quorum (unhealed partition, more than f faults)
    A->>A: re-close, then fail safe: nothing installed
  end
  opt blind mode: aggregate norm above S or gate failure
    A->>P: gossip opening of own commitment (peer-to-peer dispute)
    P->>A: openings, every node checks and excludes the violator, re-mask
  end
  A->>P: gossip signed eval report (before/after accuracy on own test set)
  A->>A: regression gate on all reports, acfa-verify own receipt
  A->>A: install only if gate passes AND acfa-verify exits 0
